OL,3,GNEWSACourse aims to stem shortage of
OL,4,A'crucial' nurses
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn apprenticeship course has been
OL,7,Flaunched to help reverse a shortage of
OL,8,Fnurses who specialise in caring for
OL,9,Fpeople with learning disabilities.
OL,11,FThe number of specialist learning
OL,12,Fdisability nurses in England has
OL,13,Freduced by almost half in the last 15
OL,14,Fyears, according to the Royal College
OL,15,Fof Nursing.
OL,17,FFifteen students have now completed a
OL,18,Fcourse at Plymouth Marjon University in
OL,19,FDevon aimed at mature students who want
OL,20,Fto specialise in learning disability.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
