OL,3,GNEWSACourse aims to stem shortage of
OL,4,A'crucial' nurses
OL,5,
OL,6,FGail Wilson, senior nurse for nursing,
OL,7,Fmidwifery and social care, said the
OL,8,Fnurses were "absolutely crucial", while
OL,9,Fa recent government report found people
OL,10,Fwith learning disabilities in England
OL,11,Fwere dying 20 years younger than
OL,12,Fothers.
